  "description": "<h3>Role Title: Investment Banking Associate</h3><h3>Role Type: Contractor</h3><h3>Location: Remote</h3><p><a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/company-ec31db2f5fc7\">Company ec31db2f5fc7</a> is engaging Investment Banking Associates to contribute specialized financial expertise to a forward-looking customer project. In this role, you'll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input. No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters. This opportunity is ideal for professionals with deep experience in investment banking and equity research, especially those who actively utilize AI-powered platforms in their daily workflows. You'll play a key part in providing insights on how modern AI tools integrate into the investment banking research, modeling, and deal process.</p><h3>Scope of Work</h3><ol>\n<li>Deliver real-world insights by sharing how AI tools are incorporated into financial modeling, research, and day-to-day deal analysis.</li>\n<li>Produce high-quality example workflows, analyses, or reports using AI platforms relevant to investment banking and equity research.</li>\n<li>Evaluate and provide feedback on the effectiveness and accuracy of AI-driven research and modeling outputs.</li>\n<li>Detail your approach to leveraging AI in streamlining data collection, financial modeling, or valuation work.</li>\n<li>Describe the practical impacts and limitations of AI tools within your project work or across deal cycles.</li>\n<li>Participate in collaborative assignments to compare traditional methods with AI-enhanced approaches, highlighting efficiencies and challenges.</li>\n<li>Communicate findings clearly through both written and verbal channels to support AI training and optimization.</li>\n</ol><h3>Preferred Qualifications</h3><ol>\n<li>Substantial background in investment banking, equity research, corporate finance, asset management, or closely related financial analysis and deal-oriented disciplines.</li>\n<li>Hands-on, day-to-day experience as an Associate, VP, or Analyst actively involved in research, modeling, and transaction processes.</li>\n<li>Direct experience using one or more AI platforms for financial professionals (e.g., Rogo, Hebbia, Model ML, development tooling for Financial Services, or similar).</li>\n<li>Strong written and verbal communication skills, with a demonstrated ability to articulate technical and analytical concepts to varied audiences.</li>\n<li>Ability to outline and contextualize the adoption and integration of AI tools within a team or across project workflows.</li>\n<li>Experience in delivering actionable insights and constructive feedback to optimize tools and processes.</li>\n<li>Familiarity with evolving trends in financial technology and a passion for advancing industry best practices through innovation.</li>\n</ol><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
